    },
    {
      "text": "Four broad washes leave pale lanes; cross them before the grinder so later cloth repairs will be unnecessary.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The linen is joined with soft bands remaining. Place the broad shared shadow first, then two substantial wood masses; the box will be filled across its center before seams.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The flat brush made narrow rails despite its nominal width. Switch to broad round crossings to fill the front, keeping the soft shadow beneath it.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
